      }
    },
    "349e387b-77bd-49f6-a607-2aacbdd8bf29": {
      "type": "testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "quote_7tHDzn": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 4,
            "heading": "<strong>Un casque sans fil hyper performant pour profiter de ses films et séries.</strong>",
            "message": "<p>J'ai acheté ce casque pour regarder la télé le soir sans réveiller toute la maison, et franchement, l'expérience sonore est tout simplement parfaite.Aucun décalage entre le son et l'image : Grâce à la connexion 2.4G via l'émetteur, la faible latence fait toute la différence. Le son est parfaitement synchronisé avec les mouvements des lèvres à l'écran, ce qui est indispensable pour les films ou les matchs.qui le rend compatible avec la grande majorité des écrans récents comme plus anciens.</p>",
            "author": "Isabelle W."
          }
        },
        "quote_mnwHHf": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>I can hear the TV again</strong>",
            "message": "<p>This device helped me hear the TV while laying in bed. It wasn’t inhibitory. It worked out very well. It’s very durable. I like the it’s quality. It’s very comfortable easy to use. It’s very good price and battery. Life lasts quite a long</p>",
            "author": "Ted"
          }
        },
        "quote_8nBhg6": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Il y a vraiment le choix de connexion</strong>",
            "message": "<p>📺 Il y a vraiment le choix de connexion, peut-être connecté sur un ancien téléviseur✅️L'émetteur se connecte rapidement quelques secondesJe n'ai pas remarqué de latence, au contraire, offre une excellente synchronisation, avec une très bonne qualité de son 🎶🎵🚉Peut-être utilisé en train ❌️ Pas recommandé en avion ✈️Un casque avec un véritable choix de connectivité et sans fil, confortable même après de longues sessions, technologie à très faible latence, synchronisation rapide et précise, une réussite ✅️</p>",
            "author": "Jean Dupont"
          }
        },
        "quote_bVCg8e": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Enjoy TV Your Way: Dual Wireless Headphones for Private Listening Without the Cables</strong>",
            "message": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; These dual-mode wireless headphones make TV watching more convenient, especially for people who want to enjoy their favorite shows without disturbing others. With both 2.4GHz wireless connectivity and Bluetooth, the headphones offer flexibility across devices and listening setups. The included transmitter helps connect compatible TVs and other supported equipment, making this a useful option for movie nights, late-night viewing, or households with different preferred listening volumes.</p>",
            "author": "moogie14"
          }
        },
        "quote_ctqQbr": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Excellent sound and easy set up</strong>",
            "message": "<p>Great Sound and Easy to Use.These wireless TV headphones are a great option for watching TV without disturbing others. The sound is clear and loud, and the over-ear design is comfortable for extended viewing. I like that they offer both Bluetooth and 2.4G connectivity, making them versatile for different devices. The transmitter is a nice addition, and the low-latency feature helps keep the audio in sync with the picture. A convenient product and a great value. Easy Bluetooth connectivity.</p>",
            "author": "Happy Happy Joy Joy"
          }
        },
        "quote_6Gi8AF": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>The combination of wireless technologies&nbsp;</strong>",
            "message": "<p>The combination of wireless technologies can be particularly appealing for users who want an alternative to traditional wired headphones. Depending on device compatibility, the Bluetooth connection may also work with other personal electronics, while the dedicated transmitter offers another option for TV viewing. Before purchasing, check which audio outputs your television supports, whether the transmitter connects through USB or another required port, and whether your preferred devices are compatible.</p>",
            "author": "JCAK"
          }
        },
        "quote_4gTqBF": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Auriculares inalámbricos para TV colgando del cuello</strong>",
            "message": "<p>Muy cómodo: tener los auriculares colgando del cuello. Muy positivo: incluye varias clases de cables para elegir. Una vez que se haya aprendido como funciona (no es tan complicado), es muy agradable usarlos. Además se puede uno mover por las estancias cercanas y seguir escuchando el audio del programa de TV.</p>",
            "author": "Joseline"
          }
        },
        "quote_fbQ49F": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Excellent headphones for TVs&nbsp;</strong>",
            "message": "<p>I ordered these Nightwooolf Wireless TV Headphones for Seniors & Hearing Impaired, Semi-in-Ear TV with Independent L/R Volume Adjustment, Large Buttons, Lightweight, Support USB/Optical/RCA/3.5mm Connections for Most TVs as I am already losing my hearing and wear NHS hearing aids (had since my mid 40’s) My hearing aids are good but don’t give me a full range back so wanted to try these as an alternative.</p>",
            "author": "S.Mackay"
          }
        },
        "quote_PL6jyg": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Un véritable choix de connectivité, sans fil et confortable&nbsp;</strong>",
            "message": "<p>J'aime beaucoup regarder la télé tard le soir, j'ai aussi souvent tendance à augmenter le volume car j'aime entendre correctement et être vraiment dans la scène 🎬Avec ce casque, mon entourage n'est plus dérangé par mes heures tardives et moi j'entends vraiment mieux 👌✅️Confortable même après de longues séances 🎧Un confort d'écoute sans déranger mon entourage 🔈➕️➕️Compatible avec 99 % des téléviseurs grâce à son émetteur USB universel.➡️Dispose de : Sortie optique, USB, AUX, RCA et du Bluetooth !</p>",
            "author": "Marie Martin"
          }
        },
        "quote_njMhmH": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Great Headphones, good features, great sound.</strong>",
            "message": "<p>These are really great headphones. &nbsp;I’ve had Sharper Image, Miracle Ears, that don’t measure up. &nbsp;The 3 levels of audio are outstanding. &nbsp;The headset can be charged on the base unit or the headset alone using USB-C, &nbsp;nice. &nbsp;Long battery life, good quality workmanship. &nbsp;Nice product for sure.</p>",
            "author": "PrettyRock"
          }
        },
        "quote_d93DCf": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>PERFETTO E ADATTO A QUALUNQUE SOLUZIONE</strong>",
            "message": "<p>Ottimo prodotto che si adatta praticamente a qualunque uscita audio e di conseguenza a qualunque televisore. Il kit comprende i cavi per adattarsi a qualunque soluzione. Potete passare da un uscita all'altra con un semplice clic sul tasto dell'apparecchio e i controlli sulle cuffie rendono molto semplice regolare l'audio.Ottimo prodotto consigliato per chi vuole godersi la televisione, magari di notte, senza disturbare il resto della casa e i vicini.</p>",
            "author": "Cirik88"
          }
        },
        "template--21230859977023__349e387b-77bd-49f6-a607-2aacbdd8bf29-quote-1": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>I bought this for my hearing, impaired mother who is 94&nbsp;</strong>",
            "message": "<p>My mother is having a hard time hearing the television so I bought her these headphones. She says she can hear the TV so much better now and is very happy with them.</p>",
            "author": "Phil"
          }
        },
        "template--21230859977023__349e387b-77bd-49f6-a607-2aacbdd8bf29-quote-4": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Great item. Tried others, these were best.</strong>",
            "message": "<p>Perfect fit for 83 yr old. And love the large volume controls. Also plug and play, no fiddling ti pair.</p>",
            "author": "Al Trimels"
          }
        },
        "template--21230859977023__349e387b-77bd-49f6-a607-2aacbdd8bf29-quote-2": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Easy to Use</strong>",
            "message": "<p>These headphones are easy to use and to see because of the large buttons. After I took it out of the box I was listening to music within 7 minutes. &nbsp;It is also used for sound on the TV. &nbsp;I have a hard time hearing the TV, so it worked perfectly to give me more volume. &nbsp;I feel these are a great value for the price of the headphones.</p>",
            "author": "Muehl Public Library"
          }
        },
        "quote_hP8ENV": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "heading": "<strong>Clear speech playback with useful microphone monitoring</strong>",
            "message": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; These look like ordinary over ear Bluetooth headphones but the useful part is being able to hear your own voice with very little delay. That makes them good for reading aloud and pronunciation practice because mistakes are much more obvious when heard back immediately. Voices sound clear and the microphone picks up normal speech without needing to be placed directly in front of the mouth.</p>",
            "author": "Barclay Bronson"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "quote_7tHDzn",
        "quote_mnwHHf",
